{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/title00_EN.png?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the battle stadium floating in a sky-high city, where a cast of unique characters gathers for thrilling territory battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your futuristic pogosticks\u2014 &quot;pogo gear&quot; !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your rhythm, and pull off awesome tricks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Claim victory in the POGO Stadium!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/gif00_trick.gif?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/title01_EN.png?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you drop into the arena, smash through the floors made of blocks and carve out your own territory. <br>Disconnect sections of the floor to create isolated zones\u2014these become your turf! <br>Gather energy as you claim ground, and use it to attack your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But watch your step\u2014secure your landing spots, or you might fall. <br>If you drop, you'll return to your own base... and from there, you'll only be able to move on the floors you\u2019ve separated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/gif01_jinti_get.gif?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/title02_EN.png?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle locally with up to four players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your strategy around each stadium's unique layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch up your attack style by customizing your pogo gear, and find your own approach to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All characters have equal abilities\u2014winning comes down to skill alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/gif02_attack.gif?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/title03_EN.png?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle a host of unique solo stages in single-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against mysterious dark shadows modeled after yourself, and out-of-control system robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the secrets hidden somewhere in the sky city, and solve the mysteries using your rhythm and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/gif03_soro.gif?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748190?t=1749025885","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748190?t=1749025885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/20d5e10dd7165c4ba5a9417665bfe29da70ee3b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749025885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/20d5e10dd7165c4ba5a9417665bfe29da70ee3b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749025885","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\