ayout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch up your attack style by customizing your pogo gear, and find your own approach to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All characters have equal abilities\u2014winning comes down to skill alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/gif02_attack.gif?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/title03_EN.png?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle a host of unique solo stages in single-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against mysterious dark shadows modeled after yourself, and out-of-control system robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the secrets hidden somewhere in the sky city, and solve the mysteries using your rhythm and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/extras/gif03_soro.gif?t=1749025885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Kyoto Entertainment Works Inc."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3672410","name":"POGO Stadium"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748190/0a12f3d665c5a03fe091ab0e08260fd0d0beaea3/header.jpg?t=1749025885","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257150855,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.aka